        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend: solid arrow = data flow within a boundary; dashed arrow = cross-cutting / optional connection.&#10;PS (blue) = hardware partner delivery scope, offline-capable. AS (green) = Avanade/Alliander digital scope, cloud-hosted (EEA).&#10;IAM and Physical safety systems (orange) are cross-cutting: identity federates into the edge, safety remains fully independent of the digital layer." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
